- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-c387990d-dc6c-40a3-b271-3215e31292be\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-22dfc9b2-0dcc-473e-9601-08ae4bd6494b\">게임을 완전히 종료하신 후 재접속하여</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-2e2faf6c-a36b-44a6-903c-e9f2d3364813\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-b3aa5eba-9ca7-4a5e-8255-4674893f5485\">업데이트 리소스를 다운로드해 주시기 바랍니다.</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-72e00ffe-30d3-4c2c-83ef-f6587e0fe1da\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-473fa065-7345-4f88-bf2f-1c7cf889c7dd\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-34f5db1e-b977-44b2-88b7-f01a727a93a6\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-aca6593a-261c-4182-b77c-43d1f502e159\">·····················································································</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-298ea08b-a171-4661-8b23-03f3f1e56714\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-dac5b77e-b086-47d4-ba2c-8d790b66e236\"><b>📢 3/30(월) 무점검 업데이트 안내</b></span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-2628c46c-76ab-4e0d-a730-6496d4a82761\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-cdec8bbe-6b40-4420-a45e-818cea4d0034\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-c668fe41-f874-4929-ab57-c34d6b2ca686\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-7cf80b2c-01a0-4f4d-a6b4-88ecffe3d47a\"><b>✔️ 일시</b></span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-7c10ef4e-4ab3-4f99-ad10-5dd1eff7c57e\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-0dbd130c-4372-43a1-9c7c-128a56bd5621\">- 3/30(월) 11:30 ~ 13:00 경</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-0f240a0c-12a6-4506-bbda-b8175cf08369\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-432e2492-c32a-4b59-a4a0-ab931a1c84e3\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-53b60201-6e0f-4f06-b514-51d2a7d260fc\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-2cc77532-7392-4ade-a751-dbb8c6417915\"><b>✔️ 내용</b></span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-879890a7-e3ab-4f59-83f2-303c5ded43a0\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-36d65bbd-735f-40ee-92b4-df5816219408\">1. 바이퍼 - 펑키 스트리트의 엄폐 자세에서 재장전 모션을 좀 더 자연스럽게 조정하였습니다.</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-4f08fcad-cd83-4cfe-a6f6-ed35b7de88cb\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-181cb0c1-2adc-4291-9c23-b7123bec2a12\">2. 바이퍼 - 펑키 스트리트 SD 모델의 장신구 표현을 스탠딩과 통일하였습니다.</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-4c385ff6-a3a6-4cf4-b647-f943ca8a3252\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-28d1bf99-1816-4811-9090-3f600826ba66\">3. 라이브 월페이퍼 「빛나는 청춘」의 연출을 좀 더 자연스럽게 보이도록 개선하였습니다.</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-20035585-fef2-4b77-aee0-4786451e09e0\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-e84da082-e385-4824-becc-dcb7670392ea\">4. 특정 시나리오 배경에서 일부 소품이 어색하게 보이는 현상을 수정하였습니다.</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-e59bac72-b39d-47a5-af40-3254c7ea0f61\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-84e4fe7c-44cd-46b5-8be8-a1290ff67e1e\">5. 특정 상황에서 일부 블라블라 대화방의 프로필 사진이 어색하게 보이는 현상을 수정하였습니다.</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-c43834c4-961b-4605-80f8-0ed3a9b110e5\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-01a42704-2dc1-4f87-b9c2-ed443cfc65dc\">6. 일부 언어의 로컬라이징 이슈를 수정하였습니다.</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-8865feef-33ad-46f7-ab15-12a8fff4c46b\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-564035bc-8854-4857-9c34-d26481e456a9\">7. 이벤트 패스에서 획득 가능한 [PUNKY STREET] 칭호가 의도와 다르게 표시되는 현상을 수정하였습니다.</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-74db5906-c760-4299-8f5e-d68770b3ff48\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-3397f090-c350-47fb-94eb-c3de39eb2d60\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-13d53dad-ac2c-466f-b894-5fb0d04c5bf4\"><span style=\"color:#ba0000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-006dc3de-bc16-421b-a1f0-0d7c8d774d6a\">※ 게임 재접속 후 업데이트 리소스 다운로드를 부탁드립니다.</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-ffc5cb55-ad1f-47b1-aea3-9a9f07d38139\"><span style=\"color:#ba0000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-05d8d42a-2256-4859-b927-76b74d661ef7\">※ 인앱 구매(확률형 아이템 포함)</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-e4a56f94-a7cd-4dbf-85f9-c015bf7ad131\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-b0ea215a-170d-47cc-a068-8a2fe245b424\">·····················································································</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-ba3fd00c-b372-4ad3-8cdb-8906a289f262\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-df42e420-9a21-4694-a8b9-90476bf436dd\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-0ae8b482-4417-423e-8e40-3755b181af2d\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-d0f9059f-0000-4d18-a75d-0a884351002a\">게임 이용에 불편을 드린 점 깊이 사과드립니다.</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT -->\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                    <script type=\"text/data\" class=\"__se_module_data\" data-module-v2='{\"type\": \"v2_text\", \"id\": \"SE-e99a56ee-a3a9-4758-a4e0-088996bcef12\", \"data\": {\"ctype\": \"text\"  }}'></script>\n                </div>                <div class=\"se-component se-image se-l-default\" id=\"SE-601a2c81-eb66-4956-b91a-0a49f91901e2\">\n                    <div class=\"se-component-content se-component-content-normal\">\n                        <div class=\"se-section se-section-image se-l-default se-section-align-\" style=\"max-width:100px;\">\n                                <div class=\"se-module se-module-image\" style=\"\">\n                                    <a href=\"#\" class=\"se-module-image-link __se_image_link __se_link\" style=\"\" onclick=\"return false;\" data-linktype=\"img\" data-linkdata='{\"id\" : \"SE-601a2c81-eb66-4956-b91a-0a49f91901e2\", \"src\" : \"https://nng-phinf.pstatic.net/MjAyNjAzMzBfMjU5/MDAxNzc0ODQ2ODU4Nzk1.X4AZ2nlXxuQ2FKIEji8HL2ppaTdnhGx3Ww1pPR6GE0